OL,3,ASuspected bomb hoax threats force fresh
OL,4,Aevacuations of Italian schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools across Italy have received bomb
OL,7,Fthreats for the second day in a row,
OL,8,Fsparking fresh panic and evacuations.
OL,10,FSome 3,778 schools, from Milan in the
OL,11,Fnorth to Sicily in the south, reported
OL,12,Fsimilar threats to one that created
OL,13,Fchaos on Wednesday - even though no
OL,14,Fexplosive devices have been found.
OL,16,FThe government has advised schools that
OL,17,F"in the absence of concrete evidence
OL,18,Fbeyond the simple receipt of a mass
OL,19,Femail indicating a danger, buildings
OL,20,Fmust not not be evacuated". Unlike a
OL,21,Fday earlier, only 77 schools were
OL,22,Fevacuated on Thursday, authorities say.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
